      "alt": " Starterkit STKa91xx",
      "text": "<h1>Evaluation kit based on TQMa91xxLA and TQMa91xxCA</h1>\n<p>Evaluation kit based on the minimodule TQMa91xxLA and TQMa91xxCA which are based on the i.MX 91 processor an Arm® Single Cortex®-A55 from NXP. The integrated graphics controller supports applications with requirements for displaying graphics.The starter kit has several interfaces an WiFi which allow an uncomplicated implementation of various applications.</p>",
